#     candidate) — per the ingest skill's "do not create public person-
#     nodes by default" guardrail.
#   - The "Try This" exercise steps were not split into a separate
#     implementation-record/track object — they are prompts for the reader,
#     not a documented deployment.
#   - ReFi DAO Local Node Toolkit (referenced in the article's own
#     references list as originating context) was not lifted to a separate
#     resource object here — it is this toolkit's own umbrella project, not
#     an external thing to register.

